Models and software used, not redistributed in this repository:
- Strands Decider 2B (StrandsAgents/strands-decider-2B-hobson-v19), Apache-2.0: a LoRA adapter and a readout head
  trained on Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B-Base (Apache-2.0). Its model card and LICENSE.md list the public datasets it was trained
  on and say to read each source's own terms before redistributing data built from them.
- strands-decider (strands-labs/strands-decider) and strands-agents (strands-agents/sdk-python), both Apache-2.0.
- Amazon Bedrock models (Anthropic Claude Haiku 4.5 for the LLM baseline and the alert text, Amazon Nova) are used
  through the AWS service and follow AWS's and each provider's terms.

The reusable pattern in patterns/policy/ and the handler design follow the Strands InterventionHandler
API; the idea of gating a tool call with typed Decider questions is also explored by other entries of the
same hackathon (for example upgradedev/lachesis-guard, MIT).
